# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored here. This is its own workspace
# (excluded from the root one), so the root lockfile does not constrain it and
# an ignored lock meant the native build re-resolved on every run: `cc` moved
# 1.6.0 -> 1.9.0 between v1.11.0 and v1.12.0 with no commit from this repo.
# A published wheel should be reproducible from the tag that built it.
target/
*.so
*.dylib
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
